# Technology Stack

## Frontend Core

- React 19 + TypeScript 5.x
- Next.js 16 (App Router)
- CSS Modules + HeroUI
- React Query (TanStack Query v5)

## HTTP & API

- Axios (HTTP client)
- React Query (caching and state management)

## Validation

- Zod (validation schemas)
- React Hook Form + Zod resolver

## State & Forms

- Zustand (state management)
- React Hook Form (forms)

## Styling

- CSS Modules
- HeroUI
- Lucide React (icons)
- clsx

## Development Tools

- ESLint + Prettier
- Stylelint (CSS/SCSS)
- Left Hook (Git hooks)
- Commit Lint (commit standardization)

## Utilities

- dayjs (date handling)
- nanoid (unique IDs)

## Testing

- Vitest (test runner)
- @testing-library/react (component testing)
- MSW (mock service worker)

## Backend (Future)

- Supabase + Next route handlers

## Infrastructure (Future)

- Vercel (deployment)
- Supabase (database)
- GitHub Actions (CI/CD)

## Version Requirements

- Node.js: 24.11.0 (LTS)
- pnpm: 10.20.0
- TypeScript: 5.9.3

## Browser Support

- Chrome: latest 5 versions (120+)
- Firefox: latest 5 versions (120+)
- Safari: latest 5 versions (17+)
- Edge: latest 5 versions (120+)
